ClashMetaHarmony
================

This project is a derivative work. The parts that are not original are listed
below with their license, so the obligations attached to them are visible.

ClashMetaForAndroid (GPL-3.0)
-----------------------------
https://github.com/MetaCubeX/ClashMetaForAndroid  (v2.11.35)

The ArkTS screens, view models, models and string resources in this repository
are ports of CMFA's activities, layouts and resources. Concretely:

  - entry/src/main/resources/**            converted from CMFA's res/ tree
                                           (values + XML drawables -> SVG)
  - entry/src/main/ets/pages/**            ports of CMFA's activities
  - entry/src/main/ets/viewmodel/**        ports of CMFA's *Design.kt
  - entry/src/main/ets/model/**            ports of CMFA's data classes

Layout constants, colours, string ids and behaviour were kept aligned with the
Android originals on purpose; the file headers say which Android file each port
corresponds to.

mihomo (GPL-3.0)
----------------
https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo

The `libclash.so` this project links against is a build of mihomo, produced from
unmodified upstream source plus the additions in `core/`:

  - core/ohos-main.go                       the OHOS cgo export surface
  - core/gvisor-ohos-fstat-fallback.patch   a fail-closed fallback in
                                            metacubex/gvisor's IsSocketFD
  - core/shims/**                           an android/log.h shim

The binary itself is not committed to this repository; core/build-core.sh
reproduces it from the upstream source. Corresponding source for the binary is
therefore the upstream release plus the files above.

gvisor (Apache-2.0)
-------------------
https://github.com/metacubex/gvisor (a fork of google/gvisor)

`core/gvisor-ohos-fstat-fallback.patch` modifies this package. It is applied at
build time to a local copy; the upstream license is unchanged.

